==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|inventorie}}, from {{der|en|ML.|inventorium|inventōrium}}, alteration of {{der|en|LL.|inventārium}}, from {{der|en|la|inveniō||to find out}}.

===Pronunciation===
